        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>业界高手他们的五项技能</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #f1eff7;\n      color: #29263c;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(153deg, rgba(255,255,255,.22) 0 36%, transparent 36% 100%),\n        linear-gradient(116deg, #f2f0f7 0%, #f0eef7 54%, #e4d9f4 100%);\n    }\n\n    .left-column {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 23px;\n      top: 25px;\n      width: 158px;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .english-title,\n    .chinese-title {\n      display: table;\n      margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n      background: #ffdb24;\n      color: #111;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      line-height: .98;\n    }\n\n    .english-title {\n      padding: 2px 4px 3px;\n      font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Trebuchet MS\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.15);\n    }\n\n    .chinese-title {\n      padding: 3px 3px 4px;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .watermark {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 10px;\n      bottom: -4px;\n      color: rgba(255,255,255,.84);\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 7px;\n      writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n      transform: rotate(180deg);\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 17px;\n      left: 193px;\n      width: 326px;\n      padding-right: 7px;\n    }\n\n    .section {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      height: 28px;\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n      padding: 0 9px 0 5px;\n      color: #272138;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 28px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      background: #ffdb21;\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 98% 0, 100% 88%, 2% 100%);\n    }\n\n    .section-heading .number {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      width: 19px;\n      height: 19px;\n      margin-right: 5px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #e94a55;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      line-height: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading.green .number {\n      background: #19a873;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading.orange .number {\n      background: #f0a834;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading.lime .number {\n      background: #b6c900;\n    }\n\n    .section-heading.teal .number {\n      background: #1baf9c;\n    }\n\n    .item {\n      position: relative;\n      min-height: 26px;\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      padding: 0 0 0 25px;\n      color: #39354d;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .item::before {\n      content: \"✦\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 6px;\n      top: 1px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      width: 12px;\n      height: 12px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #e94a55;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      line-height: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .section-orange .item::before {\n      background: #efa934;\n    }\n\n    .section-lime .item::before {\n      background: #bfd000;\n    }\n\n    .section-green .item::before {\n      background: #18ae78;\n    }\n\n    .section:first-child {\n      margin-bottom: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .section-orange {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .section-lime {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .section-green {\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .section-green .item {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .emphasis {\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"left-column\" aria-label=\"标题\">\n      <div class=\"english-title\">Master</div>\n      <div class=\"english-title\">Coach</div>\n      <div class=\"chinese-title\">业界高手</div>\n      <div class=\"chinese-title\">他们的五项</div>\n      <div class=\"chinese-title\">技能</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\">ZONG HENG SI HAI</div>\n\n    <section class=\"content\" aria-label=\"五项技能\">\n      <section class=\"section section-red\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading\">\n          <span class=\"number\">1</span>\n          知识矩阵\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"item\">从个人角度思考，推演出无穷无尽的点</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">是一种神秘的混合物，包含了技术上的知识、策略、经验</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">能信手拈来，判断理解学生的进度，接下来应该朝哪个方向努力</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">这是「教」的知识矩阵，属于伯乐独有的心理表征，而不是「做」的知识矩阵。教学是一项区别于亲身实践的独立技能。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section section-orange\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading orange\">\n          <span class=\"number\">2</span>\n          洞察力\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"item\">著名的篮球教练John Wooden，对一些球员大多是教练，对另一些球员则主要是批评</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">Wooden认为，每一位球员的身高、体重、背景、智力、才能，都不一样，每一位球员都需要区别对待</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">好的教练必须拥有对他人（而不仅仅是对自己）极高的洞察力，才能因材施教</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section section-lime\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading lime\">\n          <span class=\"number\">3</span>\n          简洁的指示\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"item\">John Wooden的讲话少超过20秒；动作示范才3秒</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">在记录的2326次教练行为中，仅6.9%是表扬，6.6%是批评，75%是规律性的指导；读唇？怎么做，何时强先</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">示范使用色分总：先看整体如何，再拆解（或演示错误的做法），再整体</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">这对表达能力是很高的要求</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section section-green\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading green\">\n          <span class=\"number\">4</span>\n          个人魅力\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"item\">天才的早期老师，大多不是业界高手，但天才会跟他们学习长达5-6年的时间</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">他们是遇神授予喜欢的老师，人和词可亲。对孩子鼓励，给予孩子褒奖，赞扬孩子等</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">万事开头难，一开始处处都在出错，重点是把这件事变得令人向往，愉快，能坚持；有所回报</p>\n        <p class=\"item\">教练必须拥有共情力，有个人魅力，牢牢吸住学生</p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
